            "D : Présent : le sens est passé."
          ],
          "example": "I was reading when he called."
        },
        "en": {
          "rule": "Background interrupted action → was/were + -ing.",
          "why_wrong": [
            "A: Plural subject: 'were'.",
            "B: The simple past alone does not show the background action.",
            "D: Present: the meaning is past."
          ],
          "example": "I was reading when he called."
        }
      },
